<title>B3YOND | Creative media and technology studio in Ajman</title>
<meta name="description" content="B3YOND is an Ajman-based creative studio producing brand content, interactive event experiences and digital products.">
<style>
:root {color-scheme:light;--ink:#112e2c;--paper:#f7f5ef;--line:#c4cfca;--aqua:#a6e6d5}
* {box-sizing:border-box}
body {margin:0;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font:18px/1.55 'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif}
a {color:inherit;text-underline-offset:5px}
a:focus-visible {outline:3px solid #dd861c;outline-offset:5px}
.wrap {width:min(1220px,89%);margin:auto}
header,footer {display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:20px;padding:24px 0}
.brand {font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-.075em;font-size:31px;line-height:1;text-decoration:none}
nav {display:flex;gap:28px;font-size:15px}
nav a {text-decoration:none}nav a:hover {text-decoration:underline}
.hero {display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr 1fr;background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper);overflow:hidden}
.intro {padding:clamp(34px,5vw,82px);align-self:center}
.location {color:var(--aqua);font-size:14px;letter-spacing:.08em;margin:0 0 30px}
h1,h2,h3,p {margin-top:0}
h1,h2 {font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-.06em;line-height:1.01}
h1 {font-size:clamp(48px,5.7vw,86px);margin-bottom:26px}
.intro p:not(.location) {max-width:36ch;color:#e1ede6}
.button {display:inline-flex;gap:24px;align-items:center;background:var(--aqua);color:var(--ink);padding:12px 21px;border-radius:30px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;font-size:15px;margin-top:8px}
.button:hover {background:white}
.photo {display:block;width:100%;height:100%;min-height:430px;object-fit:cover;max-height:620px}
section {scroll-margin-top:16px}
.services {padding:80px 0 68px}
h2 {font-size:clamp(39px,4.1vw,60px);margin-bottom:34px}
.cards {display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:36px}
article {border-top:2px solid var(--ink);padding-top:22px}
h3 {font-size:clamp(22px,2.1vw,30px);letter-spacing:-.045em;line-height:1.18;font-weight:550;margin-bottom:15px}
article p,.studio p {color:#39514d;margin-bottom:0}
.studio {background:#e4eee6;padding:clamp(30px,5vw,65px);display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.5fr;gap:36px}
.studio h2 {margin:0}.studio p+p {margin-top:16px}
footer {margin-top:35px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);font-size:14px;flex-wrap:wrap}footer p {margin:0}
@media(max-width:720px){.wrap{width:91%}header{padding:20px 0}nav{gap:18px}.hero,.cards,.studio{grid-template-columns:1fr}.photo{height:235px;min-height:0;object-position:50% 43%}.services{padding:48px 0}.cards,.studio{gap:24px}.intro{padding:32px 25px}.location{margin-bottom:18px}footer{align-items:flex-start}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
<header><a class="brand" href="#top" aria-label="B3YOND homepage">B3YOND</a><nav aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="#services">Services</a><a href="#studio">Studio</a></nav></header>
<main id="top">
<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="headline"><div class="intro"><p class="location">Ajman, United Arab Emirates</p><h1 id="headline">Creative media<br>and technology.</h1><p>We produce films and photography for brands, build websites and design interactive experiences for live events.</p><a class="button" href="#services">Explore our services <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div><img class="photo" src="data:image/webp;base64," width="860" height="1075" alt="Camera body and lenses on a studio work surface"></section>
<section id="services" class="services"><h2>What we do</h2><div class="cards">
<article><h3>Content production</h3><p>From the first storyboard to the final edit, we create brand films, product photography and short-form content for social channels.</p></article>
<article><h3>Interactive events</h3><p>We design photo booths, touchscreen kiosks and live displays. We build the guest experience and support the equipment on site.</p></article>
<article><h3>Websites and digital tools</h3><p>We build campaign websites, event microsites and dashboards that help teams manage their day-to-day work.</p></article></div></section>
<section id="studio" class="studio"><h2>The studio</h2><div><p>B3YOND is a creative media and technology studio based in Ajman, UAE. Our team brings production, design and software development together under one roof.</p><p>For an event, that can mean designing the kiosk guests use, producing the visuals on screen and building the page where guests collect their photos.</p></div></section>
</main><footer><a class="brand" href="#top">B3YOND</a><p>Zany Beyond Art FZE LLC · Ajman, United Arab Emirates</p></footer></div>
</body></html>
